msgid "Our plugins"
msgstr "Il-plugins tagħna"

msgid "Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Il-plugins ta’ Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Generous, privacy-first WordPress plugins — built in Denmark. Free cores, no"
" credits, your data stays on your site."
msgstr ""
"Plugins ta’ WordPress ġenerużi u li jpoġġu l-privatezza l-ewwel — mibnija "
"fid-Danimarka. Qlub b’xejn, l-ebda krediti, id-dejta tiegħek tibqa’ fuq is-"
"sit tiegħek."

msgid "More from Lynbro"
msgstr "Aktar minn Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Our growing suite of free, privacy-first plugins. Already-installed ones are"
" marked."
msgstr ""
"Is-suite tagħna dejjem tikber ta’ plugins b’xejn u li jpoġġu l-privatezza "
"l-ewwel. Dawk li diġà huma installati huma mmarkati."

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Installat"

msgid "On WordPress.org"
msgstr "Fuq WordPress.org"

msgid "Coming soon"
msgstr "Dalwaqt"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installa"

msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Tgħallem aktar"

msgid "About Lynbro"
msgstr "Dwar Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Lynbro builds genuinely free, privacy-first WordPress plugins with generous "
"free cores — no credits, no paywalls on the essentials, your data on your "
"own site. Made in Denmark."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro tibni plugins ta’ WordPress tassew b’xejn u li jpoġġu l-privatezza "
"l-ewwel b’qlub b’xejn ġenerużi — l-ebda krediti, l-ebda paywalls fuq "
"l-affarijiet essenzjali, id-dejta tiegħek fuq is-sit tiegħek stess. Magħmula"
" fid-Danimarka."

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Żur Lynbro"

msgid "Suggest a feature or report a bug"
msgstr "Issuġġerixxi karatteristika jew irrapporta bug"

msgid ""
"Feedback opens our public roadmap on plugins.lynbro.dk in a new tab — "
"nothing is sent from your site."
msgstr ""
"Ir-rispons jiftaħ ir-roadmap pubbliku tagħna fuq plugins.lynbro.dk f’tab "
"ġdida — xejn ma jintbagħat mis-sit tiegħek."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Għodod"

msgid ""
"Export this plugin&#8217;s settings as a JSON backup, or reset them to "
"defaults. 100% local — nothing leaves your site."
msgstr ""
"Esporta s-settings ta’ dan il-plugin bħala backup JSON, jew irritornahom "
"għad-defaults. 100% lokali — xejn ma joħroġ mis-sit tiegħek."

msgid "Export settings (JSON)"
msgstr "Esporta s-settings (JSON)"

msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Irrisettja għad-defaults"

msgid "About Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Dwar Lynbro SMTP"

msgid ""
"WordPress sends email with PHP mail() by default, which inboxes treat as "
"suspicious. Lynbro SMTP sends it through a real, authenticated mail server "
"instead — the one of your host, your mailbox or a sending service — so "
"password resets, orders and contact forms arrive."
msgstr ""
"WordPress jibgħat email b'PHP mail() b’mod awtomatiku, li l-inboxes iqisuh "
"suspettuż. Lynbro SMTP jibgħatha permezz ta’ server tal-posta reali u "
"awtentikat minflok — dak tal-host tiegħek, tal-kaxxa tal-posta tiegħek jew "
"ta’ servizz ta’ tibgħit — sabiex ir-reset tal-password, l-ordnijiet u "
"l-formoli ta’ kuntatt jaslu."

msgid ""
"Everything is in the free plugin: the log, resend, the backup connection, "
"alerts, diagnostics and WP-CLI. There is no paid version."
msgstr ""
"Kollox jinsab fil-plugin b’xejn: il-log, ibgħat mill-ġdid, il-konnessjoni "
"ta’ backup, l-avviżi, id-dijanjosi u WP-CLI. M’hemm l-ebda verżjoni mħallsa."

msgid "How your data is handled"
msgstr "Kif jiġu ttrattati d-data tiegħek"

msgid ""
"Email goes straight from your server to the SMTP server you set. The plugin "
"contacts no Lynbro service and sends no statistics anywhere."
msgstr ""
"L-email tmur direttament mis-server tiegħek lejn is-server SMTP li "
"ssettjajt. Il-plugin ma jikkuntattja l-ebda servizz ta’ Lynbro u ma jibgħat "
"l-ebda statistika imkien."

msgid ""
"The SMTP password is encrypted with your site's security keys, never shown "
"again and never written to the log or the settings export."
msgstr ""
"Il-password tal-SMTP tiġi kriptata biċ-ċwievet ta’ sigurtà tas-sit tiegħek, "
"qatt ma tintwera mill-ġdid u qatt ma tinkiteb fil-log jew fl-esportazzjoni "
"tas-settings."

msgid ""
"The log keeps recipients, subject and status in your own database. Message "
"content only for failed emails by default, and every entry is deleted after "
"the retention period."
msgstr ""
"Il-log iżomm ir-riċevituri, is-suġġett u l-istatus fid-database tiegħek "
"stess. Il-kontenut tal-messaġġ biss għal emails falluti b’mod awtomatiku, u "
"kull entrata titħassar wara l-perjodu ta’ żamma."

msgid ""
"Log entries are included in Tools → Export Personal Data and Erase Personal "
"Data."
msgstr ""
"L-entrati tal-log huma inklużi f’Għodod → Esporta Dati Personali u Ħassar "
"Dati Personali."

msgid ""
"A failure webhook, if you set one, receives only the error text and a link "
"to your log."
msgstr ""
"Webhook ta’ falliment, jekk issettjajt wieħed, jirċievi biss it-test tal-"
"iżball u link għall-log tiegħek."

msgid "Keep the login in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Żomm il-login fil-wp-config.php"

msgid ""
"Any of these constants overrides the field in Settings, and the value never "
"reaches the database or its backups:"
msgstr ""
"Kwalunkwe minn dawn il-kostanti tissostitwixxi l-field fis-Settings, u "
"l-valur qatt ma jasal fid-database jew fil-backups tagħha:"

msgid "WP-CLI"
msgstr "WP-CLI"

msgid "Version & links"
msgstr "Verżjoni u links"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Verżjoni"

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Paġna ewlenija tal-plugin"

msgid "Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbro"

msgid "Send a test email"
msgstr "Ibgħat email tat-test"

msgid ""
"No SMTP server is set yet, so the test goes out with PHP mail(). Fill in "
"Settings first to test SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Għadu ma ġie ssettjat l-ebda server SMTP, allura t-test jintbagħat b'PHP "
"mail(). Imla s-Settings l-ewwel biex tittestja l-SMTP."

msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "Riċevitur"

msgid "Test the backup connection"
msgstr "Ittestja l-konnessjoni ta’ backup"

msgid "SMTP conversation (password hidden)"
msgstr "Konversazzjoni SMTP (password moħbija)"

msgid ""
"Test emails ignore test mode and \"do not send\" mode, so you can check the "
"connection on a staging copy."
msgstr ""
"L-emails tat-test jinjoraw il-modalità tat-test u l-modalità \"tibgħatx\", "
"sabiex tkun tista’ tivverifika l-konnessjoni fuq kopja ta’ staging."

msgid "Can this server reach the SMTP server?"
msgstr "Dan is-server jista’ jilħaq is-server SMTP?"

msgid ""
"Many hosts block outgoing mail ports. This checks the usual ones to your "
"saved host, from this web server."
msgstr ""
"Ħafna hosts jimblukkaw il-portijiet tal-posta ħierġa. Dan jiċċekkja l-aktar "
"komuni lejn il-host salv tiegħek, minn dan is-server web."

msgid "Check ports"
msgstr "Iċċekkja l-portijiet"

msgid "Sender domain: %s"
msgstr "Dominju tal-mittent: %s"

msgid "DNS lookups are not available on this server."
msgstr "It-tfittxijiet DNS mhumiex disponibbli fuq dan is-server."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes your SMTP provider (for example "
"include:spf.brevo.com)."
msgstr ""
"Kun żgur li jinkludi lill-fornitur tal-SMTP tiegħek (pereżempju "
"include:spf.brevo.com)."

msgid ""
"No SPF record. Add one at your DNS host that names your SMTP provider, or "
"many inboxes will distrust the email."
msgstr ""
"L-ebda rekord SPF. Żid wieħed mal-host tad-DNS tiegħek li jsemmi l-fornitur "
"tal-SMTP tiegħek, jew ħafna inboxes ma jafdawx l-email."

msgid ""
"No DMARC record. Gmail and Yahoo require one for bulk senders; even a simple"
" \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" helps."
msgstr ""
"L-ebda rekord DMARC. Gmail u Yahoo jeħtieġu wieħed għal min jibgħat bil-"
"massa; anke \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" sempliċi jgħin."

msgid ""
"DKIM is set up at your SMTP provider (they give you the DNS record). It "
"cannot be checked from here without the selector name."
msgstr ""
"DKIM huwa ssettjat għand il-fornitur tal-SMTP tiegħek (huma jagħtuk ir-"
"rekord DNS). Ma jistax jiġi ċċekkjat minn hawn mingħajr l-isem tas-selector."

