msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Qed jiġi ċċekkjat…"

msgid "Sent. Check the inbox (and the spam folder) of the recipient."
msgstr "Mibgħut. Iċċekkja l-inbox (u l-folder tal-ispam) tar-riċevitur."

msgid "Not sent."
