msgstr "M'għandekx permessi biżżejjed biex taċċessa din il-paġna."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Is-settings"

msgid "Test & diagnostics"
msgstr "Test u dijanjostika"

msgid "Email log"
msgstr "Log tal-email"

msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Feedback"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Dwar"

msgid ""
"Send every WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log,"
" resend, a backup connection and failure alerts. All free, no upsells."
msgstr ""
"Ibgħat kull email ta' WordPress permezz tas-server SMTP tiegħek stess — "
"b'log tal-email, tibgħat mill-ġdid, konnessjoni ta' riżerva u twissijiet "
"dwar falliment. Kollox b'xejn, mingħajr upsells."

msgid "The email was sent again."
msgstr "L-email intbagħtet mill-ġdid."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again — see the newest log entry for the reason."
msgstr ""
"L-email ma setgħetx tintbagħat mill-ġdid — ara l-aktar daħla reċenti fil-log"
" għar-raġuni."

msgid "The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent."
msgstr ""
"Il-kontenut ta' din l-email ma nżammx, allura ma tistax tintbagħat mill-"
"ġdid."

msgid "Log entries deleted."
msgstr "Id-daħliet tal-log tħassru."

msgid ""
"Settings imported. Enter the SMTP password once and save — passwords are "
"never copied from other plugins."
msgstr ""
"Is-settings ġew importati. Daħħal il-password SMTP darba u salva — il-"
"passwords qatt ma jiġu kkopjati minn plugins oħra."

msgid "Set in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Impostat f'wp-config.php"

msgid "Email is sent through %1$s on port %2$s."
msgstr "L-email tintbagħat permezz ta' %1$s fuq il-port %2$s."

msgid ""
"No SMTP server set yet — WordPress still sends with PHP mail(). Pick your "
"provider below, fill in the login and save."
msgstr ""
"Għad m'hemmx server SMTP issettjat — WordPress għadu jibgħat b'PHP mail(). "
"Agħżel il-fornitur tiegħek hawn taħt, imla d-dettalji tal-login u salva."

msgid "Delivery is switched off: emails are logged but not sent."
msgstr ""
"Il-kunsinna hija mitfija: l-emails jiġu rreġistrati iżda ma jintbagħtux."

msgid "Test mode: every email goes to %s instead of its recipients."
msgstr ""
"Modalità ta' test: kull email tmur għand %s minflok lir-riċevituri tagħha."

msgid ""
"The saved password can no longer be read because the site's security keys "
"changed. Enter it again and save."
msgstr ""
"Il-password salvata ma tistax tinqara aktar għax iċ-ċwievet tas-sigurtà tas-"
"sit inbidlu. Daħħalha mill-ġdid u salva."

msgid "Last failure %1$s ago: %2$s"
msgstr "L-aħħar falliment %1$s ilu: %2$s"

msgid "Show failed emails"
msgstr "Uri l-emails falluti"

msgid ""
"Also active: %s. Two mail plugins fight over the same email — deactivate the"
" other one."
msgstr ""
"Attiv ukoll: %s. Żewġ plugins tal-posta qed jiġġieldu fuq l-istess email — "
"iddiżattiva l-ieħor."

msgid "Import settings from %s"
msgstr "Importa s-settings minn %s"

msgid "SMTP server"
msgstr "Server SMTP"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Fornitur"

msgid "Port and encryption"
msgstr "Port u encryption"

msgid "TLS (STARTTLS) — usually port 587"
msgstr "TLS (STARTTLS) — normalment port 587"

msgid "SSL — usually port 465"
msgstr "SSL — normalment port 465"

msgid "None — only for a server on the same network"
msgstr "Xejn — biss għal server fl-istess netwerk"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Awtentikazzjoni"

msgid "The server needs a username and password (almost always)"
msgstr "Is-server jeħtieġ username u password (kważi dejjem)"

msgid ""
"The password comes from LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS in wp-config.php and is not stored "
"in the database."
msgstr ""
"Il-password tiġi minn LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS f'wp-config.php u ma tinħażinx fid-"
"database."

msgid "Saved — leave empty to keep it"
msgstr "Salvat — ħalliha vojta biex iżżommha"

msgid "Remove the saved password"
msgstr "Neħħi l-password salvata"

msgid ""
"Stored encrypted with your site's security keys and never shown again. To "
"keep it out of the database entirely, define it in wp-config.php (see "
"About)."
msgstr ""
"Maħżuna b'mod kriptat biċ-ċwievet tas-sigurtà tas-sit tiegħek u qatt ma "
"tintwera mill-ġdid. Biex iżżommha kompletament barra mid-database, "
"iddefinixxiha f'wp-config.php (ara Dwar)."

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "Ċertifikat"

msgid "Verify the server certificate"
msgstr "Ivverifika ċ-ċertifikat tas-server"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Default"

msgid "Untick only for your own server with a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Neħħi l-marka biss għal server tiegħek b'ċertifikat self-signed."

msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Mittent"

msgid "Force this address on every email, whatever other plugins set"
msgstr ""
"Ġiegħel dan l-indirizz fuq kull email, irrispettivament minn x’jissettjaw "
"plugini oħra"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Rakkomandat"

msgid ""
"Use an address on a domain your SMTP account may send for, or providers "
"reject or spam-folder the email."
msgstr ""
"Uża indirizz fuq dominju li l-kont SMTP tiegħek jista’ jibgħat għalih, jew "
"il-fornituri jirrifjutaw l-email jew ipoġġuha fil-folder tal-ispam."

msgid "Force this name too (off: forms and shops keep their own sender name)"
msgstr ""
"Ġiegħel dan l-isem ukoll (mitfi: il-formoli u l-ħwienet iżommu l-isem tal-"
"mittent tagħhom stess)"

msgid "Default Reply-To"
msgstr "Default Reply-To"

msgid ""
"Used only when an email has no Reply-To of its own, so contact-form replies "
"still go to the visitor."
msgstr ""
"Użat biss meta email ma jkollhiex Reply-To tagħha stess, sabiex it-tweġibiet"
" tal-formoli ta’ kuntatt xorta jaslu għand il-viżitatur."

msgid "Return-Path"
msgstr "Return-Path"

msgid "Send bounces to the From address"
msgstr "Ibgħat il-bounces lill-indirizz From"

msgid "Backup connection"
msgstr "Konnessjoni ta’ riżerva"

msgid ""
"When the main server fails, the same email is sent again through the backup "
"at once — the visitor never sees an error."
msgstr ""
"Meta s-server ewlieni jonqos, l-istess email tintbagħat mill-ġdid minnufih "
"permezz tar-riżerva — il-viżitatur qatt ma jara żball."

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Riżerva"

msgid "Use a backup when the main server fails"
msgstr "Uża riżerva meta s-server ewlieni jonqos"

msgid "Another SMTP server"
msgstr "Server SMTP ieħor"

msgid "PHP mail() of this server (better than nothing; may land in spam)"
msgstr ""
"PHP mail() ta’ dan is-server (aħjar minn xejn; jista’ jispiċċa fl-ispam)"

msgid "Backup host"
msgstr "Ospitanti tar-riżerva"

msgid "Backup port"
msgstr "Port tar-riżerva"

msgid "Backup encryption"
msgstr "Kriptar tar-riżerva"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Xejn"

msgid "Backup login"
msgstr "Login tar-riżerva"

msgid "Backup password"
