msgstr ""
"Ma nstab l-ebda setting ta’ WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP jew Post "
"SMTP fuq dan is-sit."

msgid "Download the log (CSV)"
msgstr "Niżżel il-log (CSV)"

msgid "Delete every log entry?"
msgstr "Tħassar kull entrata fil-log?"

msgid "Empty the log"
msgstr "Ixxotta l-log"

msgid "Is it working for you?"
msgstr "Jaħdem għalik?"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is free, with nothing locked. If it got your email delivered, a "
"short review helps other people find it."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP huwa b’xejn, mingħajr xejn imsakkar. Jekk għen biex l-email "
"tiegħek tintbagħat, reviżjoni qasira tgħin lil oħrajn isibuh."

msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Ħalli reviżjoni fuq WordPress.org"

msgid "Something missing or broken?"
msgstr "Xi ħaġa nieqsa jew miksura?"

msgid ""
"Bug reports and ideas are read by the people who build the plugin. Opening "
"these links sends nothing from your site."
msgstr ""
"Rapporti ta’ bugs u ideat jinqraw min-nies li bnew il-plugin. Il-ftuħ ta’ "
"dawn il-links ma jibgħat xejn mis-sit tiegħek."

msgid "Ask in the support forum"
msgstr "Staqsi fil-forum ta’ appoġġ"

msgid "Suggest a feature (public roadmap)"
msgstr "Issuġġerixxi funzjonalità (roadmap pubblika)"

msgid ""
"Posting a log line? Remove addresses first — the Test tab already hides the "
