msgstr "Entrata tal-log #%d"

msgid "[%s] Email delivery problem"
msgstr "[%s] Problema fit-twassil tal-email"

msgid "Email delivery"
msgstr "Twassil tal-email"

msgid "Email is sent through SMTP"
msgstr "L-email tintbagħat permezz ta’ SMTP"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends this site's email through an authenticated SMTP server."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP jibgħat l-email ta’ dan is-sit permezz ta’ server SMTP "
"awtentikat."

msgid "Open Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Iftaħ Lynbro SMTP"

msgid "Email is sent with PHP mail(), not SMTP"
msgstr "L-email tintbagħat b’PHP mail(), mhux bl-SMTP"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is active but no SMTP server is set, so email still leaves "
"through PHP mail() and often lands in spam."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP huwa attiv imma l-ebda server SMTP ma huwa ssettjat, għalhekk "
"l-email xorta toħroġ permezz ta’ PHP mail() u ħafna drabi tispiċċa fl-ispam."

msgid "The saved SMTP password can no longer be read"
msgstr "Il-password SMTP salvata ma għadhiex tista’ tinqara"

msgid ""
"The site's security keys changed after the password was saved. Enter the "
"SMTP password again."
msgstr ""
"Iċ-ċwievet tas-sigurtà tas-sit inbidlu wara li l-password ġiet salvata. "
"Daħħal il-password SMTP mill-ġdid."

msgid "Emails failed to send in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "L-emails ma ntbagħtux fl-aħħar 24 siegħa"

msgid "The main SMTP connection failed in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Il-konnessjoni SMTP ewlenija fallew fl-aħħar 24 siegħa"

msgid "Email delivery (7 days)"
msgstr "Twassil tal-email (7 ijiem)"

msgid "Sent: %1$s · Failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Intbagħtu: %1$s · Fawwlu: %2$s"

msgid "No SMTP server is set yet — email is sent with PHP mail()."
msgstr ""
"Għadu ma ġiex issettjat server SMTP — l-email tintbagħat b’PHP mail()."

msgid "Show failed"
msgstr "Uri dawk li fallew"

msgid "Main connection: %1$s — Backup connection: %2$s"
msgstr "Konnessjoni ewlenija: %1$s — Konnessjoni backup: %2$s"

msgid "Test email from %s"
msgstr "Test email minn %s"

msgid ""
"This is a test email from %1$s, sent by Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can read it, email delivery works.\n"
"\n"
"Sent: %2$s\n"
"Connection: %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Din hija email tat-test minn %1$s, mibgħuta minn Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"Jekk tista’ taqraha, it-twassil tal-email qed jaħdem.\n"
"\n"
"Intbagħat: %2$s\n"
"Konnessjoni: %3$s"

msgid "backup"
msgstr "backup"

msgid "main"
msgstr "prinċipali"

msgid ""
"The server refused the username or password. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho and iCloud"
" need an app password, not the normal one; SendGrid and Brevo need an "
"SMTP/API key."
msgstr ""
"Is-server irrifjuta l-isem tal-utent jew il-password. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho u"
" iCloud jeħtieġu app password, mhux waħda normali; SendGrid u Brevo jeħtieġu"
" SMTP/API key."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 has SMTP sign-in switched off for this mailbox. An "
"administrator can enable \"Authenticated SMTP\" for it, or use a relay "
"service instead."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 għandha d-daħla SMTP mitfija għal din il-kaxxa tal-posta. "
"Amministratur jista’ jattiva \"Authenticated SMTP\" għaliha, jew juża "
"servizz ta’ relay minflok."

msgid ""
"The server could not be reached. Many hosts block outgoing ports 25, 465 and"
" 587 — run the port check below, then ask your host to open the port or use "
"the one that is open."
msgstr ""
"Is-server ma setax jintlaħaq. Ħafna hosts jimblukkaw il-portijiet ħerġin 25,"
" 465 u 587 — agħmel il-kontroll tal-port hawn taħt, imbagħad itlob lill-host"
" tiegħek jiftaħ il-port jew juża dak li hu miftuħ."

msgid ""
"The secure connection failed. Check that port and encryption match (587 = "
"TLS, 465 = SSL). If the server uses a self-signed certificate, untick "
"\"Verify the server certificate\"."
msgstr ""
"Il-konnessjoni sigura falliet. Iċċekkja li l-port u l-encryption jaqblu (587"
" = TLS, 465 = SSL). Jekk is-server juża ċertifikat self-signed, neħħi "
"l-marka minn \"Verify the server certificate\"."

msgid ""
"The server does not let this account send as the From address. Use an "
"address on a domain the account owns, and switch on \"Force From email\"."
msgstr ""
"Is-server ma jħallix lil dan il-kont jibgħat bħala l-indirizz From. Uża "
"indirizz fuq domain li l-kont għandu, u ixgħel \"Force From email\"."

msgid "The host name does not resolve. Check it for typos."
msgstr "L-isem tal-host ma jirrisolvix. Iċċekkjah għal żbalji ta’ kitba."

msgid ""
"Read the last SERVER lines of the transcript: the server usually says "
"exactly what it did not like."
msgstr ""
"Aqra l-aħħar linji SERVER tat-transcript: is-server normalment jgħid eżatt "
"x’ma għoġbux."

msgid "No host set."
msgstr "L-ebda host issettjat."

msgid "That log entry no longer exists."
msgstr "Dak l-entrata tal-log ma teżistix aktar."

msgid ""
"The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent. Change "
"\"Keep message content\" in Settings to resend future emails."
msgstr ""
"Il-kontenut ta’ din l-email ma nżammx, għalhekk ma tistax tintbagħat mill-"
"ġdid. Ibdel \"Keep message content\" f’Settings biex tibgħat emails futuri "
"mill-ġdid."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again. The new attempt and its error are in the "
"log."
msgstr ""
"L-email ma setgħetx tintbagħat mill-ġdid. L-attentat il-ġdid u l-iżball "
"tiegħu jinsabu fil-log."

msgid "Date (UTC)"
msgstr "Data (UTC)"

msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Destinatarji"

msgid "Lynbro SMTP email log"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP email log"

msgid ""
"The rest of the suite. What is already on this site is marked; nothing "
"installs without you asking for it."
msgstr ""
"Il-bqija tas-suite. Dak li diġà hemm fuq dan is-sit hu mmarkat; xejn ma jiġi"
" installat mingħajr ma titlob għalih."

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Attiv"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "Attiva"

msgid "Install now"
msgstr "Installa issa"

msgid "View on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Ara fuq WordPress.org"

msgid ""
"Shared Lynbro components v%1$s, provided by %2$s (newest of %3$d versions on"
" this site)."
msgstr ""
"Komponenti kondiviżi ta’ Lynbro v%1$s, provduti minn %2$s (l-aktar verżjoni "
"ġdida minn %3$d verżjonijiet fuq dan is-sit)."

msgid "Reset all settings to defaults?"
msgstr "Irrisettja s-settings kollha għal dawk predefiniti?"

msgid ""
"Is Lynbro SMTP getting your email delivered? A few words on WordPress.org "
"help others find a mail plugin without upsells."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP qed iwassallek l-email? Ftit kliem fuq WordPress.org jgħinu lil "
"oħrajn isibu plugin għall-posta mingħajr upsells."

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Ikteb review"

msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Le grazzi"

msgid ""
"Redirect mode needs an address to redirect to — mail is sent normally until "
"you add one."
msgstr ""
"Il-modalità redirect teħtieġ indirizz biex tibgħat lejh — il-posta "
"tintbagħat b’mod normali sakemm iżżid wieħed."

msgid "Other SMTP server"
msgstr "Server SMTP ieħor"

msgid "Use the SMTP details from your host or email provider."
msgstr "Uża d-dettalji SMTP mill-host jew mill-fornitur tal-email tiegħek."

msgid ""
"Username: your full Gmail address. Password: an app password (Google Account"
" → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords), not your normal "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Username: l-indirizz sħiħ tiegħek ta’ Gmail. Password: app password (Google "
"Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords), mhux il-password "
"normali tiegħek."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 needs \"Authenticated SMTP\" enabled for the mailbox. "
"Microsoft is retiring password sign-in for SMTP; if login fails, use a relay"
" service such as Brevo or your host's SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 teħtieġ li \"Authenticated SMTP\" ikun attivat għall-kaxxa "
"tal-posta. Microsoft qed tneħħi s-sign-in bil-password għal SMTP; jekk il-"
"login ifalli, uża servizz ta’ relay bħal Brevo jew l-SMTP tal-host tiegħek."

msgid ""
"Username: the SMTP login shown under SMTP & API. Password: an SMTP key, not "
"your account password."
msgstr ""
"Username: il-login SMTP muri taħt SMTP & API. Password: SMTP key, mhux il-"
"password tal-kont tiegħek."

msgid "Username: the word \"apikey\". Password: your SendGrid API key."
msgstr "Username: il-kelma \"apikey\". Password: il-API key ta’ SendGrid tiegħek."

msgid ""
"EU accounts use smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Username and password: the SMTP "
"credentials of your sending domain."
msgstr ""
"Kontijiet tal-UE jużaw smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Username u password: il-"
"kredenzjali SMTP tad-dominju li minnu tibgħat."

msgid ""
"Change the region in the host to yours. Username and password: SMTP "
"credentials created in the SES console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Ibdel ir-reġjun fil-host tiegħek ma’ tiegħek. Username u password: "
"kredenzjali SMTP maħluqa fil-console SES (mhux iċ-ċwievet tal-aċċess AWS "
"tiegħek)."

msgid "Username and password: both are your Server API token."
msgstr "Username u password: it-tnejn huma Server API token tiegħek."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.zoho.com for accounts outside the EU. With two-factor sign-in, "
"create an app-specific password."
msgstr ""
"Uża smtp.zoho.com għal kontijiet barra l-UE. B’two-factor sign-in, oħloq "
"password speċifika għall-app."

msgid "Username: API key. Password: secret key."
msgstr "Username: API key. Password: secret key."

msgid ""
"Username and password: an SMTP user created under Sending → SMTP Users."
msgstr "Username u password: utent SMTP maħluq taħt Sending → SMTP Users."

msgid "Username: the full mailbox address. Password: the mailbox password."
msgstr ""
"Username: l-indirizz sħiħ tal-kaxxa tal-posta. Password: il-password tal-"
"kaxxa tal-posta."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.ionos.de or smtp.ionos.co.uk for those regions. Username: the full "
"mailbox address."
msgstr ""
"Uża smtp.ionos.de jew smtp.ionos.co.uk għal dawk ir-reġjuni. Username: "
"l-indirizz sħiħ tal-kaxxa tal-posta."

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"

msgid ""
"Sends all WordPress email through your own SMTP server, with a searchable "
"email log, resend, a backup connection, failure alerts and connection "
"diagnostics. No upsells."
msgstr ""
"Jibgħat l-imejls kollha ta' WordPress permezz tas-server SMTP tiegħek stess,"
" b'log tal-imejls li jista' jitfittex, tibgħat mill-ġdid, konnessjoni ta' "
"riżerva, twissijiet dwar fallimenti u dijanjostiċi tal-konnessjoni. L-ebda "
"upsells."

msgid "lynbro aps"
msgstr "lynbro aps"

msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid ""
"Host: the SMTP endpoint of your SES region, shown in the SES console under "
"SMTP settings. Username and password: SMTP credentials created in the SES "
"console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Host: l-endpoint SMTP tar-reġjun SES tiegħek, muri fil-console SES taħt is-"
"settings SMTP. Username u password: kredenzjali SMTP maħluqa fil-console SES"
" (mhux iċ-ċwievet tal-aċċess AWS tiegħek)."

msgid "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"

msgid "LynBro ApS"
msgstr "LynBro ApS"

msgid ""
"Optional. A Slack or Discord incoming webhook, or your own HTTPS endpoint "
"(JSON with \"text\" and \"content\"). The plugin posts the error text there "
"— nothing else, and only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Volontarju. Webhook deħlin ta’ Slack jew Discord, jew l-endpoint HTTPS "
"tiegħek stess (JSON b’\"text\" u \"content\"). Il-plugin jibgħat it-test "
"tal-iżball hemmhekk — xejn iżjed, u biss meta tissettja URL."

msgid "Is %s doing its job?"
msgstr "Qed jagħmel xogħlu %s?"

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you, a short "
"review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it — honest ones, "
"critical ones included."
msgstr ""
"Użajtu għal ftit ġimgħat issa. Jekk jaħdem għalik, reviżjoni qasira fuq "
"WordPress.org tgħin lil sidien ta’ siti oħra jsibuh — anke dawk onesti u "
"kritiċi."

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you — or if "
"something is missing — tell us on our public roadmap. That is how we decide "
"what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Użajtu għal ftit ġimgħat issa. Jekk jaħdem għalik — jew jekk hemm xi ħaġa "
"nieqsa — għidilna fuq ir-roadmap pubbliku tagħna. Hekk niddeċiedu x’se nibnu"
" li jmiss."

msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(jiftaħ f'tab ġdid)"

msgid "Share feedback"
msgstr "Aqsam il-feedback"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "Forsi aktar tard"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Tgħidilix aktar"

msgid "Something not working? Ask for help"
msgstr "Xi ħaġa mhix taħdem? Itlob għajnuna"

msgid "WooCommerce is active"
msgstr "WooCommerce attiv"

msgid "a form plugin is active"
msgstr "plugin tal-formola attiv"

msgid "the site is set up for Denmark"
msgstr "is-sit issettjat għad-Danimarka"

msgid "comments are open"
msgstr "kummenti miftuħa"

msgid "tracking tags are active"
msgstr "tags tat-traċċar attivi"

msgid "visitors can create accounts"
msgstr "viżitaturi jistgħu joħolqu kontijiet"

msgid "Suggested because %l."
msgstr "Ssuġġerit minħabba %l."

msgid "Suggested for this site"
msgstr "Ssuġġerit għal dan is-sit"

msgid "Hide suggestions"
msgstr "Aħbi s-suġġerimenti"

msgid ""
"Other Lynbro plugins that fit what this site uses. Nothing is installed "
"unless you click."
msgstr ""
"Plugins Lynbro oħra li jaqblu ma’ dak li juża dan is-sit. Xejn ma jiġi "
"installat sakemm ma tikklikkjax."

msgid "All Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Il-plugins kollha ta’ Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Picked from what this site already uses — read on this site, nothing is sent"
" anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Magħżula minn dak li diġà juża dan is-sit — moqrija fuq dan is-sit, xejn ma "
"jintbagħat imkien."

msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Ottimizzatur tal-Immaġini"

msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Aqleb għal WebP u AVIF, daħħal immaġini kbar fid-daqs korrett u uża lazy-"
"load — kollox fuq is-server tiegħek."

msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "AI Studio"

msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no"
" credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Ikteb u illustra postijiet bl-AI fuq OpenAI key tiegħek — bi spiża biss, "
"mingħajr credits bejniethom."

msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analitiċi"

msgid ""
"Self-hosted, cookieless analytics with funnels. Visitor data never leaves "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Analitiċi self-hosted, mingħajr cookies, b’funnels. Id-dejta tal-viżitaturi "
"qatt ma titlaq mid-database tiegħek."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Tags"

msgid ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and more without code — each tag "
"waits for consent."
msgstr ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel u aktar mingħajr kodiċi — kull tag "
"jistenna l-kunsens."

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Formoli"

msgid ""
"Forms with entries saved for free and no cap, conditional logic checked "
"server-side, and signed webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Formoli b’entrati salvati b’xejn u mingħajr limitu, loġika kondizzjonali "
"vverifikata fuq is-server, u webhooks iffirmati."

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Ivverifika"

msgid ""
"Catch mistyped e-mail domains and bad phone numbers, and confirm them with a"
" one-time code by e-mail or SMS."
msgstr ""
"Aqbad dominji tal-email żbaljati u numri tat-telefon ħżiena, u ivverifikahom"
" b’kodiċi wieħed permezz ta’ email jew SMS."

msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Cache"

msgid ""
"Reliable purging for an nginx FastCGI cache and a Redis object cache, with "
"every purge verified against the cache itself."
msgstr ""
"Tnaddif affidabbli għal nginx FastCGI cache u Redis object cache, b’kull "
"tnaddif ivverifikat kontra l-cache innifsu."

msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Ittraduċi"

msgid ""
"Run your site in several languages, with machine translation on your own "
"OpenAI key — nothing metered, nothing sold by the word."
msgstr ""
"Iċċaqlaq is-sit tiegħek f’diversi lingwi, b’traduzzjoni awtomatika fuq "
"OpenAI key tiegħek — xejn imkejjel, xejn mibjugħ bil-kelma."

msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Shield"

msgid ""
"Security headers, HTTPS with HSTS, a small firewall against injection probes"
" and the hardening switches every site needs."
msgstr ""
"Headers ta’ sigurtà, HTTPS b’HSTS, firewall żgħir kontra probes ta’ "
"injection u swiċċijiet ta’ hardening li kull sit jeħtieġ."

msgid "Anti-Spam"
msgstr "Anti-Spam"

msgid ""
"Spam checks that run on your own server. No account, no subscription, every "
"block says why — and a held message is never lost."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolli ta’ spam li jaħdmu fuq is-server tiegħek. L-ebda kont, l-ebda "
"abbonament, kull blokk jispjega għaliex — u messaġġ miżmum qatt ma jintilef."

msgid "Login Guard"
msgstr "Login Guard"

msgid ""
"Move wp-login.php, limit failed sign-ins and add app-based two-factor — with"
" three ways back in."
msgstr ""
"Mexxi wp-login.php, illimita tentattivi falluti u żid two-factor ibbażat fuq"
" app — b’tliet modi kif terġa’ tidħol."

msgid "Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Kunsens tal-Cookies"

msgid ""
"A GDPR and ePrivacy banner with Consent Mode v2, an equally prominent Reject"
" button and 35 languages."
msgstr ""
"Banner tal-GDPR u ePrivacy b’Consent Mode v2, buttuna Reject daqshekk "
"prominenti u 35 lingwa."

msgid "Activity Log"
msgstr "Reġistru tal-Attività"

msgid ""
"Who did what, when and from where — written down on your own server, "
"searchable, exportable, and deleted on your schedule."
msgstr ""
"Min għamel xiex, meta u minn fejn — miktub fuq is-server tiegħek, jista’ "
"jiġi mfittxet, esportat, u mħassar skont l-iskeda tiegħek."

msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Żamma tad-Dejta"

msgid ""
"Find where personal data actually sits in your database, then delete it on a"
" schedule — with a dry run before every deletion."
msgstr ""
"Sib fejn id-dejta personali tinsab fil-fatt fid-database tiegħek, imbagħad "
"ħassarha skont skeda — b’prova niexfa qabel kull tħassir."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Aċċessibilità"

msgid ""
"Scan every page against WCAG 2.2 AA and fix what can be fixed safely. No "
"overlay, no page limit."
msgstr ""
"Iċċekkja kull paġna kontra WCAG 2.2 AA u issolvi dak li jista’ jiġi ffissat "
"b’mod sigur. L-ebda overlay, l-ebda limitu ta’ paġni."

msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"SEO ħafif b’schema LocalBusiness b’xejn, sitemaps u social cards. Xejn ma "
"jibgħat dejta lura."

msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "SMTP Mailer"

msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"Emails ta’ WordPress permezz tas-server SMTP tiegħek — b’log tal-emails, "
"reġenerazzjoni, konnessjoni ta’ backup u alerts ta’ falliment."

msgid "Social Feed"
msgstr "Social Feed"

msgid ""
"An Instagram feed on your site without a Meta token stored in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Feed ta’ Instagram fuq is-sit tiegħek mingħajr token ta’ Meta maħżun "
"f’WordPress."

msgid "Reviews Cache"
msgstr "Cache tar-Reviżjonijiet"

msgid "Show your Google reviews without putting an API key in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Uri r-reviżjonijiet tiegħek ta’ Google mingħajr ma ddaħħal API key "
"f’WordPress."

msgid "Links"
msgstr "Links"

msgid ""
"Find broken links and manage redirects on your own server, with the reason "
"for every verdict."
msgstr ""
"Sib links miksura u immaniġġja redirects fuq is-server tiegħek, bir-raġuni "
"għal kull deċiżjoni."

msgid "Danadresse Autofill"
msgstr "Danadresse Autofill"

msgid ""
"Danish address autocomplete and validation for WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable and EDD."
msgstr ""
"Autokompliment u validazzjoni ta’ indirizzi Daniżi għal WooCommerce, "
"WPForms, Gravity, Fluent, Formidable u EDD."

msgid "Soge Lookup"
msgstr "Soge Lookup"

msgid ""
"Look up Danish vehicles (DMR) and companies (CVR) by plate, VIN or CVR "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Fittex vetturi Daniżi (DMR) u kumpaniji (CVR) permezz ta’ numru tal-pjanċa, "
"VIN jew numru CVR."

msgid "CVR Checkout"
msgstr "CVR Checkout"

msgid ""
"Danish B2B checkout for WooCommerce: CVR company autofill, CVR/EU-VAT (VIES)"
" validation and an EAN/GLN field."
msgstr ""
"Checkout B2B Daniż għal WooCommerce: awtokompliment tal-kumpanija CVR, "
"validazzjoni CVR/EU-VAT (VIES) u kamp EAN/GLN."

msgid "Danish Shipping"
msgstr "Tbaħħir Daniż"

msgid ""
"Free pickup point selection for PostNord and GLS Denmark at the WooCommerce "
"checkout, plus clean shipping methods."
msgstr ""
"Għażla b’xejn ta’ punt ta’ ġbir għal PostNord u GLS Denmark fil-checkout ta’"
" WooCommerce, flimkien ma’ metodi ta’ tbaħħir sempliċi."

msgid "API Auth"
msgstr "API Auth"

msgid ""
"JSON Web Tokens for the REST API that you can actually revoke, with scopes "
"and a journal of refusals."
msgstr ""
"JSON Web Tokens għall-REST API li tista’ tħassar verament, b’skopi u "
"reġistru ta’ rifjuti."

msgid "Failure alerts by email do not get out"
msgstr "It-twissijiet ta' falliment bl-email ma jintbagħtux"

msgid ""
"The alert email is sent with PHP mail() so that it does not depend on the "
"SMTP server, but PHP mail() failed on this server: %s Use a webhook for "
"alerts, or ask your host to enable mail()."
msgstr ""
"L-email tat-twissija tintbagħat b'PHP mail() sabiex ma tiddependix fuq is-"
"server SMTP, iżda PHP mail() fallew fuq dan is-server: %s Uża webhook għat-"
"twissijiet, jew staqsi lill-host tiegħek biex jattiva mail()."

msgid ""
"This is the previous version of Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer has replaced"
" it and uses the same settings. Remove the folder %s with your host's file "
"manager, FTP or SSH — do not use Delete here: its uninstall erases the "
"shared SMTP settings. Lynbro SMTP Mailer keeps a backup and puts them back, "
"but the old plugin also empties the email log."
msgstr ""
"Din hija l-verżjoni preċedenti ta’ Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer ħa postha"
" u juża l-istess settings. Neħħi l-folder %s bil-maniġer tal-fajls tal-host "
"tiegħek, permezz tal-FTP jew tal-SSH — tużax Ħassar hawn: id-"
"diżinstallazzjoni tiegħu tħassar is-settings SMTP kondiviżi. Lynbro SMTP "
"Mailer iżomm kopja ta’ riżerva u jirrestawrahom, iżda l-plugin l-antik "
"ineħħi wkoll ir-reġistru tal-emails."

msgid ""
"Your SMTP settings were deleted by another plugin on %s and have been "
"restored from the backup. Nothing for you to do; send a test email if you "
"want to be sure."
msgstr ""
"Is-settings SMTP tiegħek tħassru minn plugin ieħor fis-%s u ġew restawrati "
"mill-kopja ta’ riżerva. M’għandek għalfejn tagħmel xejn; jekk trid tkun "
"ċert, ibgħat email tat-test."

msgid ""
"This site sends with the server's own mail (PHP mail()). The test shows "
"whether the server accepted the email; check its headers in the inbox "
"(Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."
msgstr ""
"Dan is-sit jibgħat l-emails permezz tas-sistema tal-posta tiegħu stess (PHP "
"mail()). It-test juri jekk is-server aċċettax l-email; iċċekkja l-headers "
"tagħha fil-kaxxa tal-inbox (Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes this web server (its IP address with ip4: or ip6:, or "
"a: / mx: that resolves to it)."
msgstr ""
"Kun żgur li dan jinkludi dan is-web server (l-indirizz IP tiegħu b’ip4: jew "
"ip6:, jew a: / mx: li jindika lejh)."

msgid ""
"Email is sent with this server's own mail (PHP mail()), from %s, with a "
"matching Return-Path."
msgstr ""
"L-email tintbagħat permezz tas-sistema tal-posta ta’ dan is-server stess "
"(PHP mail()), minn %s, b’Return-Path li jaqbel."

msgid ""
"Return-Path is off: the server puts its own address on the envelope, so SPF "
"checks that domain instead of yours."
msgstr ""
"Return-Path huwa mitfi: is-server ipoġġi l-indirizz tiegħu stess fuq "
"l-envelop, għalhekk l-SPF jiċċekkja dak id-dominju minflok tiegħek."

msgid "Email is sent with the server's own mail, with a matching sender"
msgstr ""
"L-email tintbagħat permezz tas-sistema tal-posta tas-server stess, "
"b’indirizz tal-mittent li jaqbel"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends with PHP mail() by your choice and sets the From address "
"and Return-Path on every email. Keep this server in the domain's SPF record."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP jibgħat permezz ta’ PHP mail() skont l-għażla tiegħek u "
"jistabbilixxi l-indirizz From u Return-Path fuq kull email. Żomm dan is-"
"server fir-rekord SPF tad-dominju."

msgid "This server's own mail (PHP mail(), no SMTP)"
msgstr ""
"Is-sistema tal-posta ta’ dan is-server stess (PHP mail(), mingħajr SMTP)"

msgid ""
"For servers that are set up to send mail themselves. No login needed: the "
"From address and the Return-Path below are still set on every email, so SPF "
"and DMARC can line up. The domain's SPF record must include this server."
msgstr ""
"Għal servers konfigurati biex jibagħtu l-posta waħedhom. M’hemmx bżonn ta’ "
"login: l-indirizz From u r-Return-Path hawn taħt xorta jiġu stabbiliti fuq "
"kull email, sabiex l-SPF u d-DMARC ikunu jistgħu jaqblu. Ir-rekord SPF tad-"
"dominju jrid jinkludi dan is-server."
